  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Smart connectivity </h3> <h1> Add-on »z.Integration« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS with the <strong>add-on »z.Integration«</strong> is the vendor-neutral tool management solution for established manufacturing environments. As a true brownfield connector, the system connects to hundreds of interfaces and seamlessly integrates different third-party systems into a central tool database – without compromise. Regardless of which systems are in use – from presetting and measuring machines to automatic storage systems, ERP and CAM environments – ZOLLER TMS ensures a continuous flow of data throughout the entire tool lifecycle.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/en_DE/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/7/csm_zIntegration_product_38b70f8400.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 852
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
