  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Add-on »z.Integration« </h3> <h2> Process quality </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"extra-large-text large-text\">With this add-on, existing investments are fully preserved – without having to exchange existing systems. </p> <p class=\"extra-large-text large-text\">This add-on measurably speeds up processes – thanks to an automated and end-to-end data flow. </p> <p class=\"extra-large-text large-text\">The add-on removes systems silos, enabling seamless integration across all application.</p>",
